# Claim Jumper: "Then if an opponent controls more lands than you, repeat this process once. If you search your library this
# way, shuffle." (CR 701.23, 701.24). On turn 5 Bot2 has two Islands to Bot1's none. Bot1 takes a Plains, leaving two lands to one,
# so the process repeats and Bot1 takes a Plateau: two each. It repeats only once, and the library is shuffled once after both
# searches, not after each.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Claim Jumper
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Plateau
Plains x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

